      "sourceTextSha256": "6be3cb4d4ac048a2a8afd391a745ab8f961ccf2a837225880bab1b3433edef7a",
      "text": "In the morning, your guide takes you through the savanna and the green fields of Kraka, where rare birds hide among the plants. After lunch, we drive deep into the jungle to reach Zintete Lodge, a beautiful place right on the Saramacca River. You eat dinner listening to the water flow. Pure magic.\n\nAccommodation at Zintete Lodge, all meals, guide and transfer included.",
